30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found out that the prefecture's rate sheet for publicly run beds is quite affordable. Also, two clubs that went inland last year had to sleep eight to a room.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I see. The lottery for public group bookings is quite competitive, and the application process is quite detailed. Also, the seniors say that year-groups mix best when everyone is sleeping in the same place.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shizue. The accounts from the two clubs that went inland were not very positive. Also, our own hall is already booked for most of the summer.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found out that the canteen closes for the vacation block, and cooking for ourselves costs two hours a day. Also, a third of the club cannot be on campus by nine in the morning without paying for a bed the night before.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"I found out that whole-building lets are quoted on a headcount fixed weeks ahead with the deposit non-refundable, so anyone who drops out late is paid for by the rest. Also, three years of receipts show group transport as the largest single line every time.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, that's interesting. I think we should consider the seniors' advice.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. It's important to think about the well-being of all members.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, that's a significant concern. We should factor in the cost and time for cooking.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, yes, it's something we need to consider carefully.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the non-refundable deposit is a significant risk. We need to ensure everyone is committed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that's a valid point. We need to think about how to handle last-minute dropouts.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, the accounts from the inland clubs were not good. Maybe we should consider a different location.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, I agree. The conditions they described are not ideal for our training.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, the first-train times are a real issue. We need to find a place where everyone can be on time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, perhaps we can have a stricter policy on dropouts and refunds.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that could work. We need to make sure everyone is aware of the consequences.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, the first-train times are indeed a problem. We need to find a balance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the non-refundable deposit is a risk, but perhaps necessary to secure a good location.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, yes, it's a balancing act. We need to consider all factors.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, I agree. It's a risk, but it might be worth it for the right location.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
